      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Questions frequently test the classification of physical divisions, particularly contrasting the Siwalik Range (Outer Himalayas) with the Greater Himalayas (Trans-Himalayan Zone).",
        "Major Passes (La) and Major Peaks are high-yield topics for matching lists and location-based questions in Indian competitive exams.",
        "Drainage systems (Major Rivers) and District geographies of Arunachal Pradesh are regularly featured in state exam MCQs."
